<report>
<title>False result probabilities</title>

<p>For an overall case rate of @population per ten thousand population tested:</p>

<p>Test SENSITIVITY = @{sensitive:roundu}%<br />
Probability of a FALSE POSITIVE result = <pval>@{positive:roundu}</pval></p>

<p>Test SPECIFICITY = @{specific:roundu}%<br />
Probability of a FALSE NEGATIVE result = <pval>@{negative:roundu}</pval></p>
</report>
